    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55638" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάχρῡσ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>overlaid with gold-leaf,
				gilded,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12.280.78
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22.1388.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1106.125
			</span></i> (Cos, <span class="entity">iv/iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				1.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.753
			</span></i> f, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμη κ. τῇ χρόᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ach.Tat.
					5.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., of
			persons, <i>gilded</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				60.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>rich in gold</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψάμμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					7.97
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> metaph.,
				<i>spurious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				5.15
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σως</span>
			<i>speciously</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
